message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code: mitochondrial L2 haplogroup and HIV disease progression in Ugandan children"
abstract: >-
  R code reproducing the tables, figures and statistical analyses of a study of
  mitochondrial haplogroups and time to HIV disease progression in a pediatric
  cohort from Uganda and Botswana (CAfGEN).
authors:
